Go-derived material
-------------------

src/net/http/{servemux,fs,transfer,cookie,client,transport,server,middleware,
request,response,header,util,handler}.rs and src/net/http/httputil/{reverseproxy,persist}.rs
port the logic of Go's src/net/http/{pattern,routing_tree,fs,transfer,cookie,client,
transport,clientconn,filetransport,server,csrf,request,response,header,responsecontroller}.go
and src/net/http/httputil/{reverseproxy,persist}.go; src/net/http/httptest/mod.rs
ports httptest/{recorder,httptest}.go; vendored golang.org/x/net/http/httpproxy supplies the
proxy-environment rules in transport.rs. tools/http_oracle.go drives the same packages in
Go for tools/http_check.py.

src/image/jpeg ports Go's src/image/jpeg/{reader,scan,huffman,dct,writer}.go: the decoder
state machine, marker handling and leniencies, the Huffman look-up decoder, the fixed-point
DCT/IDCT, and the encoder with its quantization and Huffman tables. tests/image_jpeg.rs ports
reader_test.go and writer_test.go; tests/fixtures/jpeg holds copies of the JPEG and PNG files
of Go's src/image/testdata that they read. tools/jpeg_oracle.go drives Go's image/jpeg for
tools/jpeg_check.py.

src/net/smtp ports Go's src/net/smtp/{smtp,auth}.go; tests/smtp.rs ports the auth tables of
smtp_test.go; tools/smtp_oracle.go drives Go's net/smtp for tools/smtp_check.py.

src/net/http/httptrace.rs ports Go's net/http/httptrace/trace.go (hook set and composition);
src/net/nettrace.rs ports internal/nettrace; tools/httptrace_oracle.go drives Go's transport for
tools/httptrace_check.py.

src/net/http/cgi and src/net/http/fcgi port Go's net/http/cgi/{child,host}.go and
net/http/fcgi/{child,fcgi}.go; tests/cgi.rs ports child_test.go; tools/cgi_oracle.go drives Go's
packages for tools/cgi_check.py.

src/net/http/pprof.rs ports Go's net/http/pprof/pprof.go (the index template, cmdline, symbol and error
responses); src/plugin.rs follows plugin/plugin_stubs.go; tools/pprof_oracle.go drives Go's package for
tools/pprof_check.py.

crates/sys/src/os_signal.rs ports Go's os/signal/signal.go and the signal state of runtime/sigqueue.go and
runtime/signal_unix.go (with the sigtable flags of sigtab_linux_generic.go and signal_darwin.go);
tools/signal_oracle.go drives Go's package for tools/signal_check.py.

src/reflect ports rules of Go's src/reflect: StructTag.Lookup, FieldByNameFunc,
StructOf validation, funcStr and the layout rules (type.go), convertOp and the
conversions, growslice capacity rule and Select/Copy/Append semantics (value.go),
DeepEqual (deepequal.go), VisibleFields (visiblefields.go), Swapper (swapper.go)
and Seq/Seq2 (iter.go). tests/reflect.rs and tools/derive-check/tests/reflect.rs
port tables and assertions from all_test.go, visiblefields_test.go and
iter_test.go; tools/reflect_oracle.go and tools/reflect_typed_oracle.go run
Go's reflect for the differential.

src/math/rand/mod.rs, src/math/rand/v1.rs, src/math/rand/pcg.rs,
src/math/rand/chacha8.rs, src/math/rand/gomath.rs and src/math/rand/zipf.rs
port algorithms from
Go's src/math/rand, src/math/rand/v2, src/internal/chacha8rand and
src/math/{log,exp,frexp,ldexp}.go and exp_arm64.s.

src/bytes ports the algorithms and Buffer/Reader state rules of Go's
src/bytes/{bytes,buffer,reader,iter}.go and the Rabin-Karp search from
internal/bytealg; src/bytes/tables.rs (malloc size classes) is generated from
Go's runtime by tools/bytes_tables_gen.go, and tests/bytes.rs ports tables from
bytes_test.go, buffer_test.go and reader_test.go.

src/image/draw.rs and src/image/gif.rs port Go's src/image/draw/draw.go and
src/image/gif/{reader,writer}.go; src/image/color/palette.rs is generated from
Go's image/color/palette package by tools/palette_gen.go.

src/encoding/json/scanner.rs ports Go's src/encoding/json/scanner.go (the
syntax state machine and its errors); src/encoding/json/indent.rs ports
indent.go and its HTML escaping; src/encoding/json/stream.rs ports the buffer
handling, token reader and error offsets of Go's src/encoding/json/jsontext
decoder and the v1 Decoder wrapper in v2_stream.go; src/encoding/json/fields.rs
ports the field resolution of encode.go and v2 tag parsing; the float and
string encoders follow encode.go. tests/json.rs ports tables from Go's
scanner, stream and encode tests; tests/fixtures/json_golden.txt is generated
by Go via tools/json_oracle.go.

src/multipart/reader.rs ports Go's src/mime/multipart/multipart.go (the boundary
scanner, part reader and NextPart state machine) and src/multipart/form.rs the
memory accounting of formdata.go; tests/multipart_reader.rs follows their cases.

src/encoding/json/jsontext/ ports Go's src/encoding/json/jsontext and the
internal packages it uses: decode.go, encode.go, state.go, token.go, value.go,
errors.go, options.go and quote.go, internal/jsonwire (wire.go, decode.go,
encode.go), internal/jsonflags and internal/jsonopts. src/encoding/json/v2/
ports Go's src/encoding/json/v2: arshal.go, arshal_default.go, arshal_any.go,
arshal_embedded.go, arshal_funcs.go, arshal_methods.go, errors.go, fields.go,
fold.go and options.go, with reflection replaced by the MarshalTo and
UnmarshalFrom traits (crates/derive/src/v2.rs generates them). tests/jsontext.rs
and tools/derive-check/tests/jsonv2.rs port tables and examples from Go's
state_test.go, value_test.go, token_test.go, example_test.go and
example_marshaljson_test.go; tests/fixtures/jsontext_golden.txt and
tests/fixtures/jsonv2_golden.txt are generated by Go via
tools/jsontext_oracle.go and tools/jsonv2_oracle.go.

src/encoding/ascii85.rs ports the chunked Decoder.Read buffering and sticky
error handling of Go's src/encoding/ascii85/ascii85.go.
src/text/scanner.rs ports Go's src/text/scanner/scanner.go (the buffering,
token and error rules); tests/text_scanner.rs tables are generated from scanner_test.go
and tools/text_scanner_oracle.go is the Go differential oracle.
src/index/suffixarray.rs ports the serialized layout of Go's src/index/suffixarray/
suffixarray.go (writeInt, writeSlice, readInt, readSlice, Read and Write); the suffix
array itself is built differently. tools/suffixarray_oracle.go is the Go oracle.
src/uuid.rs ports the parsing rules, error values, formatting and NewV7 clock state of
Go's uuid/uuid.go; tests/uuid.rs ports uuid_test.go. tools/uuid_oracle.go is the Go oracle.
src/expvar.rs ports the JSON rendering of Go's expvar.go (Int, Float, Map and String
String/appendJSON rules, appendJSONQuote and the expanded handler layout); tests/expvar.rs
ports expvar_test.go and tools/expvar_oracle.go is the Go oracle.
src/container/heap.rs, src/container/list.rs and src/container/ring.rs port the
algorithms of Go's src/container/{heap,list,ring}; src/sort.rs ports Go's
src/sort/search.go and the Interface API of src/sort/sort.go. tests/sort.rs,
tests/slices.rs, tests/cmp_maps_iter.rs and tests/container.rs port tables from
Go's sort, slices, cmp, maps and container tests.
src/strings ports the algorithms of Go's src/strings (strings.go, replace.go,
reader.go, iter.go, builder.go) and src/unicode/utf8; case mapping, folding and
classification come from src/unicode.

src/bufio ports the buffering rules and scanner state machine of Go's
src/bufio/{bufio,scan}.go; src/io ports the Copy/ReadAtLeast loops,
SectionReader, OffsetWriter, MultiReader/MultiWriter, TeeReader and the pipe
close semantics of Go's src/io/{io,multi,pipe}.go; src/io/fs ports
src/io/fs/{fs,glob,readdir,readfile,stat,sub,walk,format,readlink}.go and
src/testing/fstest/mapfs.go (src/io/fs/mapfs.rs); src/embed.rs ports the
lookup and error rules of src/embed/embed.go; src/io/ioutil.rs follows
src/os/tempfile.go. tests/bufio.rs, tests/io.rs and tests/io_fs.rs port tables
from bufio_test.go, scan_test.go, io_test.go, multi_test.go, pipe_test.go and
the io/fs *_test.go files.

src/math/rand/tables.rs (rngCooked, ziggurat tables and float constants) and
tests/fixtures/rand_golden.rs (golden vectors from Go's regress, PCG and
ChaCha8 tests) are generated from the Go sources by tools/rand_tables.go.

src/compress/flate/inflate.rs ports Go's src/compress/flate/{inflate,dict_decoder}.go
(Huffman table layout, validity rules, step machine and byte-exact input
consumption); src/compress/{gzip,zlib}.rs and src/compress/flate/mod.rs follow
the behaviour of Go's src/compress/{gzip,zlib,flate}. tests/flate.rs and
tests/fixtures/compress/{gunzip_tests,zlib_tests,flate_streams}.tsv port tables
from Go's flate_test.go, gunzip_test.go and zlib/reader_test.go
(tools/gen_flate_fixtures.py extracts them); tools/flate_check.py reads Go's
src/compress/testdata and src/testdata files at run time.

src/unicode/mod.rs ports Go's src/unicode/{letter,graphic,digit}.go;
src/unicode/tables.rs (range tables, case ranges and fold data) is generated
from Go's unicode package by tools/unicode_gen.go. tests/unicode.rs ports cases
from Go's unicode, unicode/utf8 and unicode/utf16 tests.

src/encoding/asn1 ports the DER parsing and encoding rules of Go's
src/encoding/asn1. tests/fixtures/asn1_golden.rs (test vectors and DER
certificates from Go's asn1_test.go) is generated by tools/asn1_vectors.go,
and tests/asn1.rs ports further cases from asn1_test.go and marshal_test.go.

src/encoding/base32.rs ports the quantum decoder of Go's src/encoding/base32/base32.go
(decode, the CorruptInputError offsets and partial output). src/encoding/csv.rs
ports the line-based readLine and readRecord and the Write and fieldNeedsQuotes
rules of Go's src/encoding/csv/{reader,writer}.go. tests/csv.rs ports cases from
Go's csv reader_test.go and writer_test.go.

src/math/big ports Go's src/math/big (arith.go, nat.go, natconv.go,
natdiv.go, natmul.go, int.go, intconv.go, intmarsh.go, prime.go, rat.go,
ratconv.go, ratmarsh.go, float.go, floatconv.go, floatmarsh.go, ftoa.go,
decimal.go and sqrt.go). tests/fixtures/big_golden.rs (the table-driven
vectors of Go's math/big *_test.go files) is generated by
tools/big_vectors.go, and tests/big.rs ports the checks of those Go tests.
src/strconv ports the syntax, error and formatting rules of Go's src/strconv
and src/internal/strconv. IsPrint and IsGraphic use src/unicode;
tests/fixtures/strconv/{testfp,
atof1k,ftoa1k}.txt are copied from internal/strconv/testdata and the *_cases.txt
fixtures are extracted from Go's atoi/atof/ftoa tests by tools/strconv_fixtures.py.
crates/crypto/tests/fixtures/*.tsv (known-answer tables, including Go's
marshaled hash states, from the test files of crypto/md5, sha1, sha256, sha512,
hmac, hkdf and pbkdf2) are generated by tools/crypto_vectors_gen.go, and
crates/crypto/tests/primitives.rs ports cases from the tests of crypto/sha3
(including the cSHAKE accumulated digests) and crypto/subtle.
The cipher fixtures in the same directory (aes, des, tdes, des_a1..a4, rc4,
cbc_aes, cfb, ctr_aes, ofb and gcm .tsv, plus the shared inputs) are the tables
of the test files of crypto/aes, crypto/des, crypto/rc4 and crypto/cipher,
generated by tools/crypto_cipher_vectors_gen.go; crates/crypto/tests/cipher.rs
ports the checks of those tests (including the GCM counter-wrap, tag-size and
tag-failure tests), and tools/crypto_cipher_oracle.go defines the Go reference
for the differential in tools/crypto_cipher_check.py.

backends/tls/src/tls/system_roots.rs ports the system root loader of Go's
src/crypto/x509/root.go, root_unix.go, root_linux.go and root_darwin.go: the
SSL_CERT_FILE / SSL_CERT_DIR rules, the Unix certificate file and directory
lists and the directory-entry rules.
src/time/gotime.rs, src/time/format.rs and src/time/duration.rs port Go's
src/time/time.go, format.go and format_rfc3339.go (the Time representation,
absolute-date calendar algorithms, rounding, encodings, layout formatting and
parsing, Duration and ParseDuration). tests/time_go.rs ports test tables from
Go's src/time/format_test.go and time_test.go, tests/time_timers.rs ports
timer and ticker tests from sleep_test.go and tick_test.go, and tools/go_api_symbols.go
uses go/doc to list Go's exported API.

src/time/location.rs ports TZif parsing, zone lookup (lookupFirstZone and
the load-time cache), POSIX TZ string evaluation (tzset), the stored-zip
zoneinfo lookup and LoadLocation/initLocal search order from Go's
src/time/zoneinfo.go, zoneinfo_read.go and zoneinfo_unix.go; src/time/mod.rs
ports Date normalization from src/time/time.go.

src/log/mod.rs, src/log/slog and src/log/syslog.rs port the behaviour of Go's
src/log/log.go, src/log/slog/{handler,json_handler,text_handler,level,record,
value,attr,logger,multi_handler}.go (the commonHandler preformatted-attribute,
group-prefix and separator state machine, quoting rules and key constants) and
src/log/syslog/syslog.go (message formats and priority constants).
tests/log.rs ports tables from log_test.go, slog's level, handler, text/json
handler and logger tests, and syslog_test.go.
src/archive/tar/{header,reader,writer,strconv,sparse}.rs and
src/archive/zip/{header,reader,writer,register}.rs port the format logic of
Go's src/archive/tar/{common,format,reader,writer,strconv}.go and
src/archive/zip/{struct,reader,writer,register}.go (header format selection,
base-256 and PAX encodings, GNU/PAX sparse maps, directory and ZIP64 record
layouts, DOS time and mode conversion). src/archive/iofs.rs ports FileMode,
WalkDir and the MapFS behaviour of Go's io/fs and testing/fstest.
src/archive/tar/api_tests.rs, tests/archive_tar.rs and tests/archive_zip.rs
port tables from Go's archive/tar and archive/zip *_test.go files, and
tests/fixtures/archive/{tar,zip}/ copies Go's archive/{tar,zip}/testdata
fixtures. tools/archive_api_oracle.go and examples/archive_api_probe.rs port
the .zsparse reader of Go's archive/zip/zip64_sparse_test.go.

src/encoding/xml (decoder.rs, encoder.rs, typeinfo.rs, unmarshal.rs, conv.rs)
ports the tokenizer, namespace stack, printer, struct-tag processing and
unmarshal logic of Go's src/encoding/xml (xml.go, marshal.go, typeinfo.go,
read.go); src/encoding/xml/tables.rs (the name-character range tables, HTMLEntity
and HTMLAutoClose) is generated from xml.go by tools/xml_tables_gen.py.
tests/xml.rs, tools/derive-check/tests/xml.rs and the Go oracle tools/xml_typed.go
port cases from Go's xml_test.go, marshal_test.go, read_test.go and
example_test.go.
src/text/template/parse ports Go's src/text/template/parse/{lex,node,parse}.go;
src/text/template ports exec.go, funcs.go, template.go, helper.go and option.go
of Go's src/text/template onto the typed value model in value.rs, and gofmt.rs
ports the verb handling of src/fmt/{print,format}.go and the map-key order of
internal/fmtsort. src/html/template ports Go's src/html/template (attr, content,
context, css, error, escape, html, js, transition, url, template) and jsonscan.rs
ports the scanner of src/encoding/json/scanner.go; jsonenc.rs follows
encoding/json's encode.go. The Go oracles (tools/template_oracle*.go) copy the
data types and helper functions of text/template/exec_test.go and
html/template/escape_test.go; tools/template_fixtures.py extracts the tables of
Go's parse, lex, exec, escape, content, js, css, url and html tests into
tests/fixtures/template/*.jsonl, and tests/fixtures/template/testdata is copied
from text/template/testdata.

