IANA time zone data
-------------------

src/time/tzdata/zoneinfo.zip is a verbatim copy of Go's lib/time/zoneinfo.zip,
compiled from the IANA Time Zone Database (tzdata/tzcode 2026c). The IANA
asserts that the database is in the public domain; see
https://www.iana.org/time-zones and src/time/tzdata/PROVENANCE.md.
src/regexp ports Go's src/regexp (regexp.go, exec.go, onepass.go) and
src/regexp/syntax (parse.go, simplify.go, compile.go, prog.go, regexp.go,
perl_groups.go). tests/fixtures/regexp_tables.rs is generated from Go's regexp
tests by tools/regexp/gen_fixtures.py; tests/fixtures/regexp/ holds Go's
regexp/testdata (re2-search.txt from RE2, Copyright The RE2 Authors, and the
AT&T/Glenn Fowler testregex .dat files) under their original licenses.

tests/context.rs ports cases from Go's src/context/x_test.go (TestCause,
TestDeadline, TestAfterFunc*, TestWithoutCancel, TestSimultaneousCancels and
others); src/context.rs follows the propagation rules of Go's
src/context/context.go.
src/net/url.rs ports Go's src/net/url/url.go (including the netip.ParseAddr
error texts); tests/url.rs ports tables from url_test.go, dumped to
tests/fixtures/url_go_tables.json by tools/gen_url_fixtures.py. src/flag.rs
ports Go's src/flag/flag.go and tests/flag.rs ports flag_test.go and the
package examples.

