src/net/http/h2 ports logic and tables from Go's net/http/internal/http2 and
vendored golang.org/x/net/http2/hpack (frame.go, errors.go, flow.go, pipe.go,
server.go, transport.go, write.go, writesched*.go, hpack, ciphers.go) and
net/http/internal/{httpsfv,httpcommon} (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go
Authors). src/net/http/h2/{hpack_tables,cipher_tables}.rs are generated from
those sources by tools/gen_hpack_tables.py; tools/h2_check.py compiles copies of
the Go packages into a scratch module as its oracle.

crates/sys/src/syscall ports Go's src/syscall: consts.rs, types.rs, zsyscall.rs and
the expected tables are generated by tools/gen_syscall.go from zerrors_linux_amd64.go,
zsysnum_linux_amd64.go, ztypes_linux_amd64.go and zsyscall_linux_amd64.go; errno.rs,
misc.rs, files.rs, sock.rs, cmsg.rs and proc.rs port the logic of syscall_linux.go,
syscall_linux_amd64.go, syscall_unix.go, dirent.go, env_unix.go, exec_unix.go,
exec_linux.go, lsf_linux.go, netlink_linux.go, sockcmsg_unix.go, sockcmsg_linux.go and
timestruct.go; crates/sys/src/ffi/spawn.rs follows forkAndExecInChild.
backends/tls/src/tls ports tables and logic from Go's crypto/tls
(BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors): the cipher suite tables
(tables.rs, generated by backends/tls/tools/gotls_tables.go from
cipher_suites.go), the alert texts (alert.go), VersionName and the String
methods of CurveID, SignatureScheme and ClientAuthType (common.go,
common_string.go), SessionState.Bytes and ParseSessionState (ticket.go), the
X509KeyPair error handling (tls.go), the LRU client session cache (cache.go),
the certificate selection rules (common.go, handshake_server.go) and, in
x509.rs, the host name matching and HostnameError text of crypto/x509
(verify.go, x509.go). backends/tls/tests/crypto_tls.rs follows tls_test.go and
handshake_client_test.go; tools/gotls_oracle.go is the reference for
tools/gotls_check.py.

src/encoding/gob ports the type-id allocation, wire format, encoder and
decoder rules of Go's src/encoding/gob, and src/net/rpc ports the server and
client logic and the debug page template of Go's src/net/rpc and
src/net/rpc/jsonrpc. tests/gob.rs and tools/derive-check/tests/{gob,rpc,jsonrpc}.rs
port tables and cases from Go's codec_test.go, encoder_test.go, type_test.go,
gobencdec_test.go and server_test.go, and tools/gob_oracle.go and
tools/rpc_interop.go drive the same packages in Go for tools/gob_check.py and
tools/rpc_check.py.
